      "README.md": "# Circle Drawer\n\nSVG hit testing, context-menu diameter editing and transactional undo/redo for whole gestures.\n\nOpen src/main.ui.rs in Code / Split / Design / Preview. All state transitions and domain logic are editable Rust; the generated JavaScript, checked WebAssembly and MIR backends share the same compiler pipeline. The browser UI ABI is used; this sample is not a standalone Cargo project.\n\nReference: https://eugenkiss.github.io/7guis/tasks/\n"
